Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of \"The Coast Is Clear\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00", "start": 0, "end": 212, "text": "The Coast Is Clear (In-Flight Safety album) The Coast Is Clear is the debut album by Canadian indie rock band In-Flight Safety, released on January 24, 2006 on Dead Daisy Records and distributed by Outside Music."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00", "start": 213, "end": 363, "text": "The album was recognized by the music industry, with the group winning three awards at the 2006 Nova Scotia Music Awards, including Album of the Year."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00", "start": 364, "end": 466, "text": "In 2007, they won three East Coast Music Awards, including Group Recording of the Year for this album."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00", "start": 467, "end": 564, "text": "The music video for \"Coast Is Clear\" was nominated for Video of the Year at the 2007 Juno Awards."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00", "start": 565, "end": 569, "text": "Lead"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01", "start": 0, "end": 135, "text": "The Coast Is Clear (Tracy Lawrence album) The Coast Is Clear is the fifth studio album released by country music artist Tracy Lawrence."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01", "start": 136, "end": 292, "text": "It produced five singles: \"How a Cowgirl Says Goodbye\", \"Better Man, Better Off\", \"The Coast Is Clear\", \"One Step Ahead of the Storm\" and \"While You Sleep\"."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01", "start": 293, "end": 466, "text": "Though the first two singles charted at #2 and #4 on the country chart, respectively, the title track was the first single of Lawrence's ca